-        "open": "lane-296 run24 close 2026-09-28 18:5x (ev24, R/U8/V ABBA x6 op cells; sx8 n512 x4; hoist x3; head x3; 47/47 rc=0). Parser note: R prints two banner lines between name and timing on some cells; the old one-gap regex dropped R iq3_xxs 10240x3x5120 in run24 only (rerun of b1g_read/b1win over ev19/ev17 with the fixed regex: output unchanged). V MISSING on iq3_s 5120x{1,6}x17408, iq4_xs 17408x{6,7}x5120, q5_K 5120x3x17408, q5_K 1024x7x5120: shapes absent from the vanilla-wt harness patch; cure = add the cases + a short leg, owed on HQ word. Order-bias witness: q4_K 248320x4x5120 U8 vs U8 GGML_ARIFI_Q4K_W5_SPLIT=0 reads 1.030 3/3, but the split admits only n=5,6 (ggml-vulkan.cpp:6899) so both legs run the SAME pipeline at n=4 = the ~3% is run-order (w5off always last in its round), the size of the within-round order bias. receipts cache/lane296/ev24 (reader b24_read.py -> b24_read.out, multiline parser fix 18:4x), ev23h/SVP-plain-RvsU8.txt."
